### ==================================================
### Note Management API Tests
### Module: Internal Notes (Prompt 10)
### ==================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@acmeToken = {{loginAcme.response.body.token}}
@techStartToken = {{loginTechStart.response.body.token}}

### ==================================================
### SETUP - Authentication
### ==================================================

### Login as Acme Tenant
# @name loginAcme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "email": "john@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as TechStart Tenant
# @name loginTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "email": "jane@techstart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================================================
### NOTE CRUD - Create Notes
### ==================================================

### Create Note 1 - Contact Note
# @name createNote1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Customer expressed strong interest in the Enterprise plan. Budget approved for Q1 implementation. Next step: schedule technical demo with IT team.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Note 2 - Deal Note
# @name createNote2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Deal status update: Proposal accepted! Contract review in progress with legal team. Expected close date: end of month.",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Note 3 - Ticket Note
# @name createNote3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Ticket resolution: Issue was caused by browser cache. Instructed customer to clear cache and cookies. Verified system is working correctly now.",
  "ticketId": "ticket-1-acme",
  "contactId": "contact-3-acme"
}

### Create Note 4 - Multi-Entity Note
# @name createNote4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Follow-up required: Customer mentioned they need additional training for their team. Schedule onboarding session for next week.",
  "contactId": "contact-2-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-2-acme",
  "ticketId": "ticket-2-acme"
}

### Create Note 5 - Strategy Note
# @name createNote5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Sales strategy: Customer is price-sensitive. Competitor analysis shows we're 15% higher. Consider offering discount for annual contract.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme"
}

### Create Note 6 - Support Context
# @name createNote6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Important: Customer has specific security requirements (SOC 2 compliance). Need to provide compliance documentation before contract signing.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Note for TechStart Tenant
# @name createNoteTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "content": "Customer onboarding completed successfully. All team members trained on basic features. Follow-up scheduled for 2 weeks.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-techstart"
}

### ==================================================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### ==================================================

### Create Note - Missing Content (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Note - No Entity Linked (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "This note has no entity link"
}

### Create Note - Invalid Contact (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Test note with invalid contact",
  "contactId": "non-existent-contact"
}

### Create Note - Invalid Deal (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Test note with invalid deal",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "non-existent-deal"
}

### Create Note - Invalid Ticket (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Test note with invalid ticket",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "ticketId": "non-existent-ticket"
}

### ==================================================
### READ OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Get All Notes (Acme Tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get All Notes with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?page=1&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### SEARCH & FILTERS
### ==================================================

### Search by Content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?search=budget
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Search by Multiple Keywords
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?search=customer training
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?contactId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Deal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?dealId=deal-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?ticketId=ticket-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Current Author (using "me")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?authorId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Specific Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?authorId=user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - Contact + Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?contactId=contact-1-acme&search=strategy
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - Deal + Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?dealId=deal-1-acme&authorId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### SORTING
### ==================================================

### Sort by Created Date (DESC - Most recent first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Created Date (ASC - Oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Updated Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?sortBy=updatedAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### UPDATE OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Update Note - Content Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "UPDATED: Customer expressed strong interest in the Enterprise plan. Budget approved for Q1 implementation. Demo scheduled for next Tuesday at 2 PM."
}

### Update Note - Add Deal Reference
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme"
}

### Update Note - Add Ticket Reference
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote6.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "ticketId": "ticket-1-acme"
}

### Update Note - Change Content and Entities
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote5.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "UPDATED STRATEGY: Customer agreed to annual contract with 10% discount. Moving forward with implementation plan.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme"
}

### ==================================================
### STATISTICS
### ==================================================

### Get Note Statistics - All Notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note Statistics - Current Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats?authorId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note Statistics - Specific Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats?authorId=user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note Statistics - For Specific Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats?contactId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note Statistics - For Specific Deal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats?dealId=deal-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note Statistics - For Specific Ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/stats?ticketId=ticket-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### TENANT ISOLATION
### ==================================================

### Attempt to Access Acme Note from TechStart (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Attempt to Update Acme Note from TechStart (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "content": "Attempting to modify another tenant's note"
}

### Attempt to Delete Acme Note from TechStart (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Verify TechStart Can Only See Their Own Notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### ==================================================
### DELETE OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Delete Note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote3.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Delete Non-Existent Note (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/non-existent-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Verify Note Deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/{{createNote3.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### ERROR HANDLING
### ==================================================

### Get Notes - No Authentication (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Notes - No Tenant Header (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### Get Notes - Invalid Token (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-xyz
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Note - Non-Existent ID (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/non-existent-note-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### ADVANCED SCENARIOS
### ==================================================

### Scenario 1: Complete Deal Notes Timeline
# Initial note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Initial contact made. Customer interested in Enterprise plan for 50 users.",
  "contactId": "contact-4-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-3-acme"
}

###
# Discovery call note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Discovery call completed. Key requirements: SSO integration, API access, custom reporting.",
  "contactId": "contact-4-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-3-acme"
}

###
# Proposal note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Proposal sent including all requested features. Pricing: $5,000/month. Waiting for feedback.",
  "contactId": "contact-4-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-3-acme"
}

###
# Get all notes for the deal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?dealId=deal-3-acme&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 2: Support Ticket Context
# Initial ticket note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Customer reported: 'Error 500 when trying to export contacts to CSV'",
  "contactId": "contact-5-acme",
  "ticketId": "ticket-3-acme"
}

###
# Troubleshooting note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Investigated issue. Problem is browser-specific (Safari). Tested on Chrome - works fine. Recommended browser switch as workaround.",
  "contactId": "contact-5-acme",
  "ticketId": "ticket-3-acme"
}

###
# Resolution note
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "content": "Issue resolved. Safari compatibility fix deployed. Customer confirmed export now working correctly.",
  "contactId": "contact-5-acme",
  "ticketId": "ticket-3-acme"
}

###
# Get all notes for the ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?ticketId=ticket-3-acme&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 3: Contact Relationship Notes
# Get all notes for a specific contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?contactId=contact-1-acme&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 4: Team Member Activity
# Get all notes by current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?authorId=me&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 5: Search Across All Notes
# Search for specific keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notes?search=security compliance
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

